 public message: I agree with Emily, recommend B, but highlight need to address crew cooperation. Provide evidence from my notes: B very conscientious, handles stress well, good at weather, computer skills; but weak memory for numbers, nasty remarks. Conclude B still best.\n\nLet's produce."}
